01:17:28.125 --> 01:17:29.000
You got another track?

1205
01:17:29.541 --> 01:17:31.625
<i>♪ By any means</i>
<i>I'm on the corner with candy ♪</i>

1206
01:17:31.708 --> 01:17:34.541
<i>♪ I sense the chance in the air</i>
<i>And the packages landed ♪</i>

1207
01:17:34.625 --> 01:17:36.625
<i>♪ I was stranded</i>
<i>On many different occasions ♪</i>

1208
01:17:36.750 --> 01:17:39.708
<i>♪ And always kept it silent</i>
<i>When facing them situations ♪</i>

1209
01:17:40.416 --> 01:17:41.458
[song stops]

1210
01:17:41.541 --> 01:17:42.458
Yeah.

1211
01:17:43.125 --> 01:17:44.125
[chuckles softly]

1212
01:17:44.958 --> 01:17:45.791
I do.

1213
01:17:45.875 --> 01:17:48.458
[rap instrumental playing]

1214
01:17:52.000 --> 01:17:52.833
Nigga.

1215
01:18:15.958 --> 01:18:18.083
[Jahkor on recording] <i>Yeah. Ey. Ey.</i>

1216
01:18:18.166 --> 01:18:20.875
<i>♪ If you scared, go to church</i>
<i>I don't blame you for it ♪</i>

1217
01:18:20.958 --> 01:18:23.416
<i>♪ Manslaughter over murder</i>
<i>They gon' hang you for it</i> ♪

1218
01:18:23.500 --> 01:18:26.250
<i>♪ Incarcerated my brother</i>
<i>I tried to take it for him ♪</i>

1219
01:18:26.333 --> 01:18:28.958
<i>♪ He's supposed...</i>
<i>He's supposed to make it for us</i> ♪

1220
01:18:29.041 --> 01:18:31.833
<i>♪ They'd rather break us</i>
<i>Than build us up in this broken system ♪</i>

1221
01:18:31.916 --> 01:18:33.083
[song stops playing]

1222
01:18:36.458 --> 01:18:37.708
So what you think, bruh?

1223
01:18:39.125 --> 01:18:42.083
I mean, that shit cool.
I just... I really can't fuck with it.

1224
01:18:43.333 --> 01:18:44.458
[Jahkor] It's all good.

1225
01:18:45.916 --> 01:18:48.500
It ain't shit to a giant, nigga.
It ain't stopping shit.

1226
01:18:49.916 --> 01:18:50.916
I'mma be good.

1227
01:18:51.666 --> 01:18:53.083
Man, do you, little nigga.

1228
01:18:55.083 --> 01:18:56.250
[chuckles softly]

1229
01:18:59.583 --> 01:19:01.333
[JD] You know I love your mother, right?

1230
01:19:03.125 --> 01:19:04.500
But I done...

1231
01:19:05.833 --> 01:19:08.041
I done did too much time.

1232
01:19:09.583 --> 01:19:12.208
Put too much work out here
in these streets

1233
01:19:12.291 --> 01:19:14.666
to let her talk to me like that.
What you think?

1234
01:19:15.916 --> 01:19:16.791
Yeah.

1235
01:19:18.916 --> 01:19:19.750
Shit.

1236
01:19:43.708 --> 01:19:45.666
One felony and they got you.

1237
01:19:47.041 --> 01:19:48.416
Trapped in this shit.

1238
01:19:50.208 --> 01:19:51.583
Won't nobody hire you.

1239
01:19:52.833 --> 01:19:55.458
They block you from food stamps,
Section 8 housing.

1240
01:19:55.791 --> 01:19:58.041
How you supposed to live, no job, no help?

1241
01:20:09.250 --> 01:20:11.625
My hands been off
in a little some of everything

1242
01:20:11.708 --> 01:20:14.125
trying to keep a paid roof
over y'all head.

1243
01:20:16.083 --> 01:20:18.458
You're young, see, everything look dreamy.

1244
01:20:21.000 --> 01:20:22.208
It's hard out here, man.

1245
01:20:33.041 --> 01:20:34.541
Don't do like me, Jah.

1246
01:20:38.458 --> 01:20:40.250
Be somebody, like your mother said.

1247
01:20:47.958 --> 01:20:49.000
I believe in you.

1248
01:21:01.750 --> 01:21:03.458
He the best cook on my tier.

1249
01:21:05.166 --> 01:21:06.541
I don't know how he do it.

1250
01:21:08.208 --> 01:21:09.875
He get his little meats,

1251
01:21:10.625 --> 01:21:12.291
buy his little season packets,

1252
01:21:12.375 --> 01:21:13.375
and throw down.

1253
01:21:15.458 --> 01:21:16.708
[chuckles]

1254
01:21:26.958 --> 01:21:29.416
So I put in a little legwork for you.

1255
01:21:30.833 --> 01:21:32.583
The Mexican who chin-checked you...

1256
01:21:33.250 --> 01:21:34.500
go by Matón.

1257
01:21:35.708 --> 01:21:37.500
You know a cat named Q?

1258
01:21:38.250 --> 01:21:41.666
People chirpin' about a TQ
that was under Malcolm thumb.

1259
01:21:47.333 --> 01:21:48.791
-Yeah.
-Listen.

1260
01:21:49.208 --> 01:21:51.333
They new boss want you dead.

1261
01:21:52.125 --> 01:21:54.541
And them screws don't wanna
get caught up in it.

1262
01:21:56.041 --> 01:21:59.625
Everybody know somebody
coming for you, but I got your back.

1263
01:22:01.666 --> 01:22:04.125
Don't trust nobody TQ send your way.

1264
01:22:06.916 --> 01:22:08.333
They give you a celly yet?

1265
01:22:11.541 --> 01:22:12.458
Nah.

1266
01:22:12.916 --> 01:22:14.916
That's 'cause they want you alone.

1267
01:22:16.833 --> 01:22:17.875
Vulnerable.

1268
01:22:17.958 --> 01:22:20.083
You ain't gotta be worrying
about all that.

1269
01:22:23.291 --> 01:22:24.250
I got me.

1270
01:22:25.791 --> 01:22:26.625
A'ight?

1271
01:22:26.958 --> 01:22:28.958
You need to stick with me, young'un.

1272
01:22:29.875 --> 01:22:30.875
In here...

1273
01:22:31.833 --> 01:22:34.125
ain't nothin' what it seems.

1274
01:22:36.750 --> 01:22:39.291
These niggas don't need a reason in here.

1275
01:22:41.458 --> 01:22:43.291
And just like on the outside...

1276
01:22:43.833 --> 01:22:45.875
they'll kill you without a second thought

1277
01:22:45.958 --> 01:22:47.583
if they can get something out of it.

1278
01:22:50.416 --> 01:22:52.500
They're holding something over that nigga.

1279
01:22:53.000 --> 01:22:57.000
Either he help them get to you,
or they gonna out him to his own people.

1280
01:22:59.583 --> 01:23:00.583
You hear me?

1281
01:23:03.125 --> 01:23:03.958
Yeah.

1282
01:23:16.875 --> 01:23:19.458
[indistinct conversations, laughter]

1283
01:24:12.916 --> 01:24:14.916
[indistinct chatter]

1284
01:24:33.916 --> 01:24:35.916
[monitor beeping]

1285
01:24:52.208 --> 01:24:53.666
[Jahkor] So, how is he, uh...

1286
01:24:56.750 --> 01:24:57.750
How's he doin'?

1287
01:24:58.625 --> 01:25:00.291
I... [sighs]

1288
01:25:00.666 --> 01:25:01.583
What?

1289
01:25:05.500 --> 01:25:07.750
The military ruined him, Jahkor.

1290
01:25:08.416 --> 01:25:09.333
They did.

1291
01:25:11.125 --> 01:25:13.750
The doctors say
that he'll never walk again.

1292
01:25:16.916 --> 01:25:18.041
I hate the Army.

1293
01:25:19.125 --> 01:25:21.208
I don't get why they even sent him there.

1294
01:25:28.750 --> 01:25:29.625
No.

1295
01:25:33.000 --> 01:25:33.916
It ain't fair.

1296
01:25:35.333 --> 01:25:36.291
He did...

1297
01:25:37.708 --> 01:25:38.916
He did everything right.

1298
01:25:40.208 --> 01:25:41.083
Jah.

1299
01:25:41.625 --> 01:25:43.708
Everything. Everything right.

1300
01:25:47.750 --> 01:25:48.875
It ain't fair.

1301
01:25:50.333 --> 01:25:52.708
[JD] Nigga, who the fuck you is?
Motherfucker talkin' crazy.

1302
01:25:52.791 --> 01:25:54.833
I want my motherfuckin' money now,
nigga, period!

1303
01:25:55.583 --> 01:25:58.041
Ey, I only look this way, boy.

1304
01:25:58.125 --> 01:26:00.291
Trust it, I will fuck you up.

1305
01:26:00.375 --> 01:26:03.250
Believe me when I tell you
I'm strictly 'bout this business.

1306
01:26:03.333 --> 01:26:04.208
Huh?

1307
01:26:04.666 --> 01:26:07.458
Nigga, I don't wanna hear that shit!
I've got mouths to feed too!

1308
01:26:09.708 --> 01:26:12.375
Nigga, do you know I will kill you?

1309
01:26:13.250 --> 01:26:15.083
I don't give a fuck
what I'm putting up my nose.

1310
01:26:15.166 --> 01:26:17.375
I better have my fuckin' money
'fore the end of this day.

1311
01:26:17.458 --> 01:26:18.541
Watch what I tell you.

1312
01:26:20.250 --> 01:26:21.333
Ey, listen,

1313
01:26:21.416 --> 01:26:25.166
I'mma talk to you like I talk to a bitch,
you ol' bitch-type nigga.

1314
01:26:25.916 --> 01:26:28.000
I'mma make you do one thing,

1315
01:26:28.083 --> 01:26:29.250
only one thing.

1316
01:26:29.583 --> 01:26:32.208
I'mma make you wanna do something
for this nigga JD.

1317
01:26:37.625 --> 01:26:38.541
Hey, Jah!

1318
01:26:38.958 --> 01:26:41.291
I'mma roll up the block.
I'mma be right back.

1319
01:26:46.750 --> 01:26:49.708
[Jahkor] <i>When the average life seems</i>
<i>less likely than hitting the lottery...</i>

1320
01:26:50.916 --> 01:26:51.875
<i>sometimes...</i>

1321
01:26:52.583 --> 01:26:53.958
<i>the choices in front of you...</i>

1322
01:26:55.458 --> 01:26:57.083
<i>don't really seem like choices at all.</i>

1323
01:26:59.583 --> 01:27:01.125
<i>And what power do we really have...</i>

1324
01:27:02.083 --> 01:27:04.291
<i>outside of being somebody's boogeyman?</i>

1325
01:27:18.375 --> 01:27:20.541
[JD] Told you, I ain't playin'.
I want my fuckin' 100.

1326
01:27:20.625 --> 01:27:23.291
-[man] Nigga, I ain't scared of you.
-Hey, I ain't askin' again.

1327
01:27:23.708 --> 01:27:24.958
Man, you must be deaf.

1328
01:27:25.041 --> 01:27:27.708
I ain't giving you my fuckin' rent money
for you to go and get high.

1329
01:27:27.791 --> 01:27:29.750
Long as I known you,
you gonna have to shoot me--

1330
01:27:29.833 --> 01:27:31.458
[gunshots]

1331
01:27:36.625 --> 01:27:38.458
[gunshots]

1332
01:27:40.625 --> 01:27:42.458
[panting]

1333
01:27:50.708 --> 01:27:53.125
["Unfortunately" by Mozzy
playing over car stereo]

1334
01:29:26.958 --> 01:29:28.458
[music stops]

1335
01:29:37.333 --> 01:29:39.416
[indistinct conversations in distance]

1336
01:29:52.750 --> 01:29:54.500
[exhales, sniffs]

1337
01:30:00.916 --> 01:30:02.208
The rest of them niggas

1338
01:30:02.291 --> 01:30:04.916
know they can't handle all the dope
they holding right now.

1339
01:30:05.000 --> 01:30:06.541
That's why they at us so tough.

1340
01:30:06.625 --> 01:30:08.333
They need clients,

1341
01:30:08.416 --> 01:30:10.166
customers, knocks.

1342
01:30:10.250 --> 01:30:12.375
And this plug gotta be
one of them Mexicans.

1343
01:30:12.791 --> 01:30:14.291
The fuck you thought?

1344
01:30:14.375 --> 01:30:17.250
They don't wait on no money.
You gotta pay them on time, feel me?

1345
01:30:17.333 --> 01:30:19.666
[Stunna] They don't want
the new clientele he tryin' to push.

1346
01:30:19.750 --> 01:30:21.833
-[La-Trice] More weight. Exactly
-More drama.

1347
01:30:21.916 --> 01:30:24.375
We getting a little too loose
with all these niggas around here.

1348
01:30:27.500 --> 01:30:28.875
Well, that's why I'm here, nigga.

1349
01:30:34.333 --> 01:30:36.083
Let me get that nigga Malcolm for y'all.

1350
01:30:39.000 --> 01:30:41.208
Oh, you been thinking
about what we talked about, huh?

1351
01:30:43.958 --> 01:30:45.208
Is that an answer, nigga?

1352
01:30:50.125 --> 01:30:51.000
Yeah.

1353
01:31:00.208 --> 01:31:02.083
I don't play around
with shit like this, nigga.

1354
01:31:03.541 --> 01:31:04.791
This grown man business.

1355
01:31:05.666 --> 01:31:07.791
Don't get yourself into something
you can't handle.

1356
01:31:10.333 --> 01:31:12.750
T, baby, tell this nigga
what you was telling me.

1357
01:31:15.166 --> 01:31:16.291
I was saying...

1358
01:31:18.916 --> 01:31:22.916
Malcolm punk-ass be over at his baby mama
house damn near every night,

1359
01:31:23.583 --> 01:31:25.208
over there near the U & I.

1360
01:31:25.291 --> 01:31:26.708
His bitch be down at the hairdresser

1361
01:31:26.791 --> 01:31:29.250
always talkin' about she got
that nigga on a leash.

1362
01:31:29.541 --> 01:31:31.208
Checking in to put
their little girl to bed.

1363
01:31:31.291 --> 01:31:33.166
My little square homie
down at the zoning office

1364
01:31:33.250 --> 01:31:35.250
got me a copy of his driver's license,

1365
01:31:35.333 --> 01:31:37.250
layout of his bitch' whole neighborhood.

1366
01:31:38.000 --> 01:31:38.875
My nigga,

1367
01:31:39.333 --> 01:31:41.041
if you hungry, I'mma put you to work.

1368
01:31:42.333 --> 01:31:45.041
Otherwise, I got some smothered
pork chops in the back, nigga.

1369
01:31:45.125 --> 01:31:46.083
[laughing]

1370
01:31:48.500 --> 01:31:49.375
I'm good.

1371
01:31:51.333 --> 01:31:52.541
Yeah, a'ight, blood.

1372
01:31:53.041 --> 01:31:55.500
Since you so serious, nigga,
when you tryin' to body him?

1373
01:31:55.583 --> 01:31:56.750
How about tonight?

1374
01:32:01.250 --> 01:32:03.250
Oh, this motherfucker right here.

1375
01:32:03.708 --> 01:32:05.041
-Go!
-[La-Trice laughs]

1376
01:32:05.125 --> 01:32:06.750
I'mma need half my money first though.

1377
01:32:06.833 --> 01:32:07.916
It's a done deal, nigga.

1378
01:32:08.000 --> 01:32:09.500
You need something to work with?

1379
01:32:20.291 --> 01:32:23.000
Both of 'em clean as a motherfucker.

1380
01:32:32.750 --> 01:32:33.583
[girl] Jahkor!

1381
01:32:35.625 --> 01:32:37.041
My uncle said your daddy a cokehead.

1382
01:32:37.833 --> 01:32:38.958
Well, that's yo daddy.

1383
01:32:39.208 --> 01:32:41.208
He be buying it on the corner
of 89th and MacArthur.

1384
01:32:42.500 --> 01:32:44.166
You don't even know
what my daddy look like.

1385
01:32:44.250 --> 01:32:45.666
I know he drive a Cadillac.

1386
01:33:07.875 --> 01:33:10.833
[Jahkor] ♪ <i>We ain't the same</i>
<i>If we ridin' round killin' niggas ♪</i>

1387
01:33:12.333 --> 01:33:13.833
<i>♪ They don't reduce the pain ♪</i>

1388
01:33:17.458 --> 01:33:19.291
[softly] <i>♪ Tryin' to feel the pain ♪</i>

1389
01:33:25.666 --> 01:33:28.666
<i>♪ The same prescriptions I be takin'</i>
<i>Don't reduce the pain ♪</i>

1390
01:33:30.375 --> 01:33:33.625
<i>♪ So pass the package to your man</i>
<i>And let him do his thing ♪</i>

1391
01:33:36.125 --> 01:33:37.791
[engine starts]

1392
01:34:20.041 --> 01:34:21.541
[dog barking in distance]

1393
01:34:33.458 --> 01:34:36.666
[Jahkor] <i>A nigga on my bus said slavery</i>
<i>taught black people how to survive...</i>

1394
01:34:37.583 --> 01:34:38.625
<i>but not how to live.</i>

1395
01:34:43.458 --> 01:34:46.291
<i>There's whole neighborhoods</i>
<i>that know more about life inside prison</i>

1396
01:34:46.750 --> 01:34:47.625
<i>than out.</i>

1397
01:34:49.541 --> 01:34:50.791
<i>Generations of...</i>

1398
01:34:51.250 --> 01:34:53.250
<i>men and women...</i>

1399
01:34:54.791 --> 01:34:57.208
<i>brothers, sisters, mothers...</i>

1400
01:34:57.833 --> 01:35:01.083
<i>fathers, aunties, uncles,</i>
<i>cousins, all of us.</i>

1401
01:35:02.375 --> 01:35:06.000
<i>All part of the same fuckin' story</i>
<i>on fuckin' repeat.</i>

1402
01:35:07.916 --> 01:35:09.333
<i>Makin' this into a life...</i>

1403
01:35:10.458 --> 01:35:12.916
<i>while everybody on the outside</i>
<i>looks in pretending...</i>

1404
01:35:13.708 --> 01:35:14.833
<i>they would do better.</i>

1405
01:35:16.333 --> 01:35:17.291
<i>Or worse...</i>

1406
01:35:19.250 --> 01:35:20.416
<i>they don't look at all,</i>

1407
01:35:21.416 --> 01:35:23.041
<i>and just act like we ain't here.</i>

1408
01:35:32.750 --> 01:35:35.083
[man] Is that cool? Like, let me take
the babies after that?

1409
01:35:35.166 --> 01:35:36.125
[woman] Yeah.

1410
01:35:36.208 --> 01:35:38.041
[children chattering]

1411
01:35:38.125 --> 01:35:41.166
-[woman] Y'all calm down a little bit.
-[man] Hey, baby, you want potato salad?

1412
01:35:41.750 --> 01:35:43.333
All right, this is for your mama.

1413
01:36:01.708 --> 01:36:03.916
That nigga TQ had shit set up perfect.

1414
01:36:04.000 --> 01:36:06.041
We had a shooter at the sideshow,

1415
01:36:06.125 --> 01:36:09.291
and he was gon' slide on La-Trice,
man, our nigga just got spotted.

1416
01:36:10.583 --> 01:36:12.541
Q want that throne hella bad.

1417
01:36:12.916 --> 01:36:15.250
So he handled all that shit.
Believe that.

1418
01:36:16.708 --> 01:36:18.083
That nigga hungry.

1419
01:36:19.125 --> 01:36:20.750
[Malcolm] I been in this shit too long.

1420
01:36:21.375 --> 01:36:24.000
I don't play.
When I know what I want, I go get it.

1421
01:36:50.791 --> 01:36:51.750
What, little nigga?

1422
01:36:52.500 --> 01:36:53.375
What's your name?

1423
01:36:54.166 --> 01:36:55.000
Malcolm.

1424
01:36:56.583 --> 01:36:57.750
You know JD?

1425
01:36:58.833 --> 01:37:00.625
The basehead that just left? Yeah.

1426
01:37:01.166 --> 01:37:02.125
Well, that's my dad.

1427
01:37:02.750 --> 01:37:05.083
So, can you please not sell drugs
to him anymore?

1428
01:37:06.041 --> 01:37:07.375
[laughs]

1429
01:37:08.500 --> 01:37:10.375
Nigga, that's my best customer, man.

1430
01:37:18.416 --> 01:37:19.750
You remember me, nigga?

1431
01:37:21.083 --> 01:37:22.125
Hell yeah.

1432
01:37:22.208 --> 01:37:23.250
We folks, right?

1433
01:37:27.750 --> 01:37:28.583
Nah.

1434
01:37:28.875 --> 01:37:30.750
[gunshots ring out in previous scene]

1435
01:37:34.666 --> 01:37:35.541
[Taye] Who is it?

1436
01:37:35.625 --> 01:37:37.666
Stop fuckin' around.
Open up the door, all right?

1437
01:37:44.083 --> 01:37:45.000
I got a knife, nigga.

1438
01:38:11.375 --> 01:38:13.208
I need you to hold something for me.

1439
01:38:23.166 --> 01:38:24.250
[Taye] They dirty?

1440
01:38:27.208 --> 01:38:29.916
Just make sure you don't
get your fingerprints on them shits.

